=head1 NAME

_GET_HEADER_K_MIRROR_ - Check for missing K-mirror IA headers

=head1 DESCRIPTION

This primitive checks each file in the frame, and if the
new K-mirror headers ROT_IAST and ROT_IAEN are missing,
estimates values for them.

New values are stored in the C<uhdr> WESLEY_SET_HEADERS
(for subsequent writing by C<_SET_HEADERS_>).

